# Shell · Skin · Primitives contract

Four-layer enforcement for guest and admin surfaces. **Marketing shell is the reference implementation.**

## Layers

| Layer | Package / location | Owns |
| ----- | ------------------ | ---- |
| Design tokens | `@app-tour/design-tokens` | Semantic CSS variables, `@theme` bridge |
| UI primitives | `@app-tour/ui-primitives` | Atoms only — token-bound CSS modules |
| Shell | `apps/*/src/**/shell/` | Structure, landmarks, `data-*` hooks, providers |
| Workspace skin | `packages/workspaces/<id>/theme/*.css` | All visual appearance |

## Body contract

```html
<body
  data-app-surface="portal | marketing | admin"
  data-workspace-plugin="{pluginId}"
  data-tenant-id="{tenantId}"
>
```

## Shell `data-slot` contract (additive)

| Slot | Portal hook | Marketing hook | Admin hook |
| ---- | ----------- | -------------- | ---------- |
| `shell` | `data-portal-shell` | — | `data-operator-shell` |
| `shell-header` | `data-portal-shell-header` | `data-marketing-header` | `data-operator-header` |
| `shell-main` | `data-portal-shell-main` | `#main-content` | `#operator-main` |
| `shell-nav` | `data-portal-shell-bottom-nav` | `data-marketing-header-nav` | `data-operator-sidebar` |
| `footer` | — | `data-marketing-footer` | — |

Existing `data-*` hooks are never removed — `data-slot` is additive only.

## Page-level `data-slot` landmarks (marketing MKT-20)

**Shell owns the document landmark** (`data-slot="shell-main"` / `#main-content` in `marketing-shell.tsx`). Tenant page roots must **not** nest `<main>` (hard guard: `scripts/guards/guard-marketing-landmark.mjs` / MKT-LANDMARK-01). Page identity is carried by `data-slot="page-*"` on a non-`<main>` root (typically `<div>`):

| Slot | Marketing hook | Source |
| ---- | -------------- | ------ |
| `page-home` | `data-marketing-home` | `apps/marketing/src/home/guest-home-full.tsx` |
| `page-catalog` | `data-marketing-catalog` | `apps/marketing/app/tours/page.tsx` |
| `page-catalog-detail` | `data-marketing-catalog-detail-page` | `apps/marketing/app/tours/[tourId]/page.tsx` |

Contract proof: `apps/marketing/test/marketing-page-landmarks.spec.ts` (`MKT-20-01` / `MKT-20-02`) — asserts `data-slot="page-*"` presence and **forbids** nested `<main>`. Workspace skins should prefer attribute selectors (`[data-slot="page-home"]` / `[data-marketing-home]`) so element tag changes do not break appearance.

## Shell forbidden in TSX

- Appearance Tailwind: `bg-*`, `text-*`, `border-*`, `shadow-*`, `backdrop-*`, `rounded-*` (visual)
- Typography utilities: `text-sm`, `font-semibold`, etc.
- `@/components/ui/*` (shadcn)
- Inline visual `style`

## Shadow-first migration

1. Add `data-slot` / `data-active` / missing hooks
2. Replicate computed styles in workspace skin CSS (`starter/theme/starter-portal.css` or workspace portal skin)
3. Verify E2E parity
4. Remove shell `className` appearance

## Portal skin stack

| Layer | File | Owns |
| ----- | ---- | ---- |
| L2 structure | `fallback-guest-portal-shell.css` | Layout on `data-portal-shell*` hooks only |
| L3 default (portal) | `starter/theme/starter-portal.css` | Shell + `/me` appearance (starter workspace) |
| L3 workspace | `packages/workspaces/<id>/theme/*-portal.css` | Brand overrides on `body[data-workspace-plugin]` |

L3 default portal skin loads dynamically in portal layout (`WORKSPACE_GUEST_PORTAL_DEFAULT_SKIN`), not from `portal-bootstrap.css`.

## Marketing skin stack

| Layer | File | Owns |
| ----- | ---- | ---- |
| L2 structure | `fallback-guest-marketing-shell.css` | Layout on `data-marketing-shell*` hooks only |
| L3 default (marketing) | `starter/theme/starter-marketing.css` | Shell chrome appearance (starter workspace) |
| L3 workspace | `packages/workspaces/<id>/theme/*-marketing.css` | Brand overrides on `body[data-workspace-plugin]` |

L3 default marketing skin loads dynamically in marketing layout (`WORKSPACE_GUEST_MARKETING_DEFAULT_SKIN`), not from `marketing-bootstrap.css`.
